sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Platform Orchestrator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as WorkbenchesReconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant PlatformCfg as PlatformConfig<br/>ConfigMap Watcher
    participant WebhookSrv as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Manifests as /opt/manifests<br/>Embedded Upstream
    participant CertProvider as service-ca / cert-manager

    Note over Orchestrator,CertProvider: Reconciliation Flow

    Orchestrator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>+ project gatewayDomain, mlflowEnabled, platform
    Orchestrator->>K8sAPI: Write odh-workbenches-config ConfigMap<br/>distribution, version, platform version
    K8sAPI-->>PlatformCfg: ConfigMap watch event<br/>(namespace-scoped)
    PlatformCfg-->>Reconciler: Trigger reconciliation
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Workbenches CR watch event<br/>(generation-changed predicate)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Read odh-workbenches-config ConfigMap<br/>GET /api/v1/configmaps
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Distribution, version, platform handshake
    Reconciler->>Manifests: Load upstream Kubeflow manifests
    Manifests-->>Reconciler: YAML manifests
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply owned operands<br/>Deployments, RBAC, Services,<br/>NetworkPolicies, Webhooks
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Applied resources
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches CR status

    Note over Orchestrator,CertProvider: Webhook Admission Flow

    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Notebook as Notebook CR<br/>kubeflow.org

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Notebook CR
    K8sAPI->>WebhookSrv: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)<br/>FailurePolicy: Fail
    WebhookSrv->>K8sAPI: GET data connection Secrets
    K8sAPI-->>WebhookSrv: Secret data
    WebhookSrv-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse<br/>(inject secret env vars)

    K8sAPI->>WebhookSrv: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)<br/>FailurePolicy: Fail
    WebhookSrv->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io
    K8sAPI-->>WebhookSrv: HardwareProfile spec
    WebhookSrv-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse<br/>(inject resources, tolerations)

    Note over Orchestrator,CertProvider: TLS Certificate Flow

    CertProvider->>K8sAPI: Provision webhook-cert Secret<br/>kubernetes.io/tls
    K8sAPI-->>WebhookSrv: Mount TLS cert + key
    WebhookSrv->>WebhookSrv: Configure TLS<br/>OpenShift APIServer profile<br/>or Mozilla Intermediate fallback

    Note over Orchestrator,CertProvider: Security Surface

    participant Monitor as Monitoring / Probes

    Monitor->>Reconciler: GET :8081/healthz<br/>HTTP, unauthenticated
    Reconciler-->>Monitor: 200 OK
    Monitor->>Reconciler: GET :8081/readyz<br/>HTTP, unauthenticated
    Reconciler-->>Monitor: 200 OK
    Monitor->>Reconciler: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS, TokenReview + SAR
    Reconciler-->>Monitor: Prometheus metrics
